  "draft_py": "# Maniacal Rage (M20) Aura. Enchant creature is compiled (keywords, with its filter).\n# s2: Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.\n#   \"gets +2/+2 and has X\" statics are one StaticAbility(Seq(MODIFY_PT, ...)) (B11-attached-pt / B5a-enchant-pt-*),\n#   \"can't block\" is Faith's Fetters' PREVENT_EFFECT over DeclareBlockersEvent (condition = filter = the enchanted object);\n#   \"enchanted creature\" in a static = FAnd(IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE, TYPE_EQ Creature) (guide).\nenchanted = FAnd(\n    children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    ),\n)\nrage = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n                'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QUnbounded(),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n                    filter=enchanted,\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n                'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.INCREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=2)),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.PREVENT_EFFECT, {\n                'condition': enchanted,\n                'event': DeclareBlockersEvent(filter=enchanted),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [rage, *compiled]\n",
